  << /ActualText (With the care to follow our platforms UI patterns and established UX principles in the redesign\054 as well as testing each flow\054 we had one client sign off on migrating to the new platform 3 months ahead of schedule \205 with minimal alterations requests to the interface\056\nFurther clients expect to greatly increase the number of e\055service they offer after moving to the new platform\056 \nUntil the EGDI scoring is released in 2026\054 we cannot say if C1 has made an impact to Canada\220s standing in the ranks\054 but we have high hopes\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 8057 0 R
     /Pg 7458 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
