  << /ActualText (CitizenOne is a secure\054 modular e\055services platform that streamlines online service delivery for governments while ensuring privacy\054 trust\054 and compliance\056 With a single\054 secure login\054 it simplifies access to services\056 Built on open standards like OAuth\057OIDC and SAML\054 its scalable architecture supports diverse users and services\056 Trusted for its ready\055to\055deploy solutions\054 CitizenOne enhances security and reduces cyber risks\056)
